/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 770 Tm (Lumen Freight Shipping API) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 742 Tm (Version 2026-10. Create rates, book shipments and follow parcels from pickup to delivery.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 710 Tm (Authentication) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 687 Tm (Every request must carry your API key in the Authorization header as Bearer followed by the key.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 671 Tm (Keys starting with lmn_test_ run against the sandbox and never create a real pickup.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 639 Tm (Conventions) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 616 Tm (Bodies and responses are JSON. Weights are in kilograms and dimensions in centimetres.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 600 Tm (Timestamps are RFC 3339 in UTC. Postal codes are strings, never numbers.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 584 Tm (Errors return a JSON object with code, message and, where useful, the offending field.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 552 Tm (1. Get rates) Tj
/F3 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 529 Tm (POST /v1/rates) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 513 Tm (Quotes every carrier service for a parcel between two addresses. Send origin and destination) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 497 Tm (objects with country \(ISO 3166-1 alpha-2\), postal_code and city, plus a parcels array. Each) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 481 Tm (parcel has weight_kg and dimensions_cm with length, width and height. The response lists) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 465 Tm (rates with carrier, service, price \(a decimal string with currency\), transit_days and quote_id.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 449 Tm (A quote_id is valid for 30 minutes and is required to create a shipment.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 417 Tm (2. Create a shipment) Tj
/F3 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 394 Tm (POST /v1/shipments) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 378 Tm (Books the parcel using a quote_id from the rates call. The body also takes the sender and) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 362 Tm (recipient contact details, a label_format of pdf or zpl, and an optional pickup_window with) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 346 Tm (start and end timestamps. A successful call returns 201 with the shipment, its id in the form) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 330 Tm (shp_ followed by 12 characters, a tracking_number, status set to booked, and a label_url.) Tj
